    "title": "Authenticated control for hosted dev-loop harnesses",
    "intro": "A focused nightly that fixes authentication when the swarm dev loop talks to a hosted harness, so pause, stop, resume, and status calls now carry the caller's credentials end to end.",
    "entries": [
      {
        "batch_id": "entry-1",
        "time_label": "11:28 PM",
        "started_at": "2026-07-09T06:28:14.000Z",
